# mbsync (isync 1.5) — one IMAP account, Fastmail, full history, maildir
# under ~/.mail/fastmail/. Decided in emacs-l88, executed in emacs-l7d;
# Gmail left in emacs-v6o (ray-a-m/emacs beads).
#
# The secret comes from the GNOME keyring (secret-tool), never from this
# file. Store it once per machine:
#   secret-tool store --label="mail fastmail" service mail account fastmail

# Global channel defaults — apply to every channel below.
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fastmail

IMAPAccount fastmail
Host imap.fastmail.com
Port 993
User ray@raymondmaung.com
PassCmd "secret-tool lookup service mail account fastmail"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore fastmail-remote
Account fastmail

MaildirStore fastmail-local
Path ~/.mail/fastmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/fastmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

# Everything, Spam included — full history is the point.
Channel fastmail
Far :fastmail-remote:
Near :fastmail-local:
Patterns *
